WEBVTT

00:08:27.092 --> 00:08:30.394
That's just some bits
within some of the INSPIRE framework.

00:08:30.418 --> 00:08:33.735
But more and more countries
are committing to implement it,

00:08:33.759 --> 00:08:35.013
adapt it locally,

00:08:35.037 --> 00:08:37.672
inform it with the relevant data,
put a plan together,

00:08:37.696 --> 00:08:39.133
work across sectors,

00:08:39.157 --> 00:08:41.133
and begin that journey to zero.

00:08:41.157 --> 00:08:44.982
Canada, Mexico,
United Arab Emirates, Tanzania --

00:08:45.006 --> 00:08:46.923
I mentioned Sweden and Uganda already --

00:08:46.947 --> 00:08:48.879
Japan, the Philippines, Indonesia,

00:08:48.903 --> 00:08:51.514
more and more countries,
and now cities, too.

00:08:51.538 --> 00:08:53.903
And right here in Scotland,

00:08:53.927 --> 00:08:56.942
University of Edinburgh
is establishing a learning lab

00:08:56.966 --> 00:09:00.268
that's going to track the journey
that cities in Scotland